  "title": "Cheese Tortellini with Italian Sausage and Mushroom-Spinach Cream Sauce",
  "description": "Cheese tortellini and sausage are paired with a cream sauce that&#39;s bursting with tomatoes, spinach, and mushrooms.",
  "authors": [
